      "text": "[5:10PM] #CBDMarina  #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic along Inner Marina Road is moving smoothly from the UBA Roundabout toward the NNPC Filling Station, continuing inward to the Cathedral Church and NITEL intersection.\n\nThere is perfect vehicular flow from the State House toward McWen Bridge, with a good connection to Force Road.\n\nMovement is also swift from underneath the Zone 2 Bridge heading toward the Flag Staff House and onward to McWen Bridge.\n\nTraffic from Onikan Roundabout by TBS toward the Water Board and linking the NITEL intersection remains steady and free-flowing.\n\nBroad Street traffic is good from the General Hospital through Tinubu Square, connecting Abibu Oki Street inward Apongbon.\n\nSimilarly, the entire stretch of Igbosere Road and Catholic Mission Street inward Ganiu Smith Street is experiencing smooth movement.\nOur personnel are on ground and actively managing traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
